" x="77" y="39.0">200</text><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="39">(萬元)</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90,14,162)" x="14" y="162">銷售額</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="118.125" y="308">第一季</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="184.375" y="308">第二季</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="250.625" y="308">第三季</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="316.875" y="308">第四季</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="14" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="185" y="25">四季銷售額走勢</text><circle cx="115" cy="137.0" fill="#DC2626" r="4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="115" y="125.0">120</text><circle cx="175" cy="92.375" fill="#DC2626" r="4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="175" y="80.375">155</text><circle cx="235" cy="111.5" fill="#DC2626" r="4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="235" y="99.5">140</text><circle cx="295" cy="66.875" fill="#DC2626" r="4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="295" y="54.875">175</text><polyline fill="none" points="115,137.0 175,92.375 235,111.5 295,66.875" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5"></polyline></svg><div style="font-size:9px; color:var(--gray); margin-top:3px;">第一季120萬→第二季155萬（升）→第三季140萬（跌）→第四季175萬（升·全年最高）。整體趨勢：波動上升。</div></div>
